    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27684" root="ظمو" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِمْوٌ</span></b> , relating to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَظْمَآء</span> of camels, is a dial.
var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِمْءٌ</span>, (M,) signifying The <i>interval between
two drinkings in the coming of camels to water.</i>
(T.) [See art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظمأ</span>.]

